Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.17,0:00:18.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又地震了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.16,0:00:20.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近震得好頻密...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.41,0:00:37.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是哪位
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.48,0:00:40.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道本小姐乃常盤台的婚后光子...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:50.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.66,0:00:56.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天好像也發生地震了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.36,0:00:58.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你宿舍那邊怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:02.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事 我那邊沒有晃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.66,0:01:06.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...同樣是第七學區 真不可思議
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.42,0:01:09.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大圄老師 那今天找我是...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.28,0:01:13.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 對對 進來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.69,0:01:18.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是第二學期轉過來的轉學生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.05,0:01:22.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且 她今後會成為你的室友
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.52,0:01:24.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉啊 這麼突然
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.06,0:01:26.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過作為我們學校的風紀委員
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.38,0:01:29.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你能幫她一把
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.82,0:01:33.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 請包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.18,0:01:38.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫春上衿衣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.54,0:03:13.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第十九學區過來的轉學生啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.53,0:03:16.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過這個時候轉學 很少見吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.18,0:03:21.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一般都是配合新學期開始才轉的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.09,0:03:25.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說佐天 看你好像很開心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.19,0:03:27.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是當然
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.79,0:03:31.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能做初春的室友 就是我的摯友候補了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.28,0:03:32.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.50,0:03:39.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這位是春上衿衣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.52,0:03:40.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後這邊是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.13,0:03:45.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,常盤台中學的白井黑子和她學姐御坂美琴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.76,0:03:49.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有和我們同班的佐天淚子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.43,0:03:50.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.53,0:03:55.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就不用這麼客氣了 怎麼會變成這樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:57.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.39,0:04:03.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去車站接春上的時候 搬家公司就通知說到了...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:07.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說 這搬家公司也該多動腦想想才行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.07,0:04:09.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之得想個辦法搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.39,0:04:11.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:16.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 原來還有這一招
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.85,0:04:22.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害 我還是第一次看到空間轉移
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.50,0:04:24.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是當然
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.48,0:04:27.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有我這種水平的空間轉移能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.48,0:04:27.12,*Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(530,436)}<Teleporter>
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.12,0:04:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在學園都市裡面也沒幾個
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.46,0:04:34.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了好了 我們趕快收拾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.72,0:04:35.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.65,0:04:44.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是搞定了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.30,0:04:49.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝各位
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.57,0:04:50.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別客氣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.36,0:04:55.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說回來 既然比想像中早搞定 找個地方去玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.31,0:04:56.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贊成～
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.45,0:04:59.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贊成什麼啊 你忘了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.83,0:05:02.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟我等一下要去開聯合會議
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.61,0:05:04.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聯合會議？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.92,0:05:07.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是風紀委員和警備員聯合開會
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.98,0:05:12.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,議題好像是關於最近的地震
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.40,0:05:13.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生地震也要開會？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.90,0:05:16.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉 對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.42,0:05:19.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那春上就跟御坂學姐還有我 三個一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.73,0:05:21.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太狡猾了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.48,0:05:23.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們開完會再跟我們會合不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:24.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.76,0:05:30.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用擔心哦 姑且不論佐天 御坂學姐人很好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.09,0:05:33.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我開完會也會馬上過來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.20,0:05:34.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說你啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.65,0:05:39.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐天 就算要開玩笑 也請你不要撩春上的裙子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.08,0:05:42.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃？為什麼我要做那種事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.57,0:05:46.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.39,0:05:50.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 去哪裡好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.97,0:05:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春上有什麼地方想去的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.99,0:05:57.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我對這個學區還不熟悉...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.96,0:05:59.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.51,0:06:01.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那果然還是要去...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.47,0:06:07.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說到能表示友好的地方 就是這裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.18,0:06:11.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說第一次見佐天的時候 也是來這裡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.77,0:06:13.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.86,0:06:17.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘴邊沾了好多奶油哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.50,0:06:19.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑子她們也夠辛苦的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.54,0:06:23.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼風紀委員跟警備員要聯合開會討論地震啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.62,0:06:26.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是事件的話還好說...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.51,0:06:29.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼 雖然剛才我沒吭聲
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.53,0:06:32.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實關於這地震 有些很熱門的傳言哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.17,0:06:36.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,關於最近頻發的地震 我們查明了一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.46,0:06:40.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就結論而言 這些並不是地震
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.88,0:06:41.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正確來說是...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.60,0:06:44.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵鬧靈？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.60,0:06:44.23,*Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(410,436)}<Poltergeist>
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.37,0:06:46.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes 就是吵鬧靈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.37,0:06:46.25,*Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(481,436)}<Poltergeist>
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.48,0:06:50.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那個吧 傢俱之類的突然開始亂晃...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:52.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說是縱波跟橫波都觀測不到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:52.28,*Default3,NTP,0,0,0,,<P波指縱波 S波指橫波 均為地震術語>
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.40,0:06:55.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是超自然現象啊 超自然現象
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.90,0:06:59.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為大概有學生會亂傳類似的謠言
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.07,0:07:00.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在這裡先跟各位說明
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.56,0:07:03.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這並不是超自然現象
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.95,0:07:08.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亂雜開放的原因 是RSPK症候群的集體發作
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.95,0:07:08.95,*Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(205,436)}<Poltergeist>
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.19,0:07:11.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,RSPK症候群的...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.43,0:07:12.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集體發作？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.20,0:07:19.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來 請先進狀況救助隊的泰瑞絲緹娜小姐為我們說明一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.36,0:07:26.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才黃泉川老師已經向各位介紹了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.77,0:07:29.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是先進狀況救助隊的泰瑞絲緹娜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.31,0:07:32.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所謂的「RSPK症候群」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.44,0:07:34.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是指能力者暫時失去自律
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.23,0:07:39.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在無意識下 自身能力失控的狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.83,0:07:41.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然產生的現象各有不同
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.24,0:07:43.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但同時發生的場合
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.31,0:07:46.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失控的能力會互相融合
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.14,0:07:51.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後一同作為亂雜開放現象發生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.14,0:07:51.43,*Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(452,436)}<Poltergeist>
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.19,0:07:55.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果亂雜開放現象的規模進一步擴大的話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.52,0:08:00.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就會產生與地震極為相似的情況
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.61,0:08:04.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是本次地震的真面目
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.55,0:08:08.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,關於RSPK症候群的集體發作的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.06,0:08:10.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在還在調查當中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.69,0:08:12.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在部分學生當中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.44,0:08:15.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會將該現象和無聊的非科學聯繫起來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.44,0:08:15.37,*Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(498,438)}<Occult>
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.57,0:08:18.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原因是來自異次元的波動 特殊的電漿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.14,0:08:23.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們想想 統括理事會秘密進行的地下實驗也是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.53,0:08:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.72,0:08:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能因此而發生集體恐慌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.50,0:08:29.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使得受害程度擴大
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.49,0:08:33.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次召集各位風紀委員
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.81,0:08:37.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是為了不要讓學生出於貪玩的心理散播謠言
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.82,0:08:39.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而敦促各位注意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.55,0:08:43.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,據說很快就要來一場大的了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.24,0:08:46.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.43,0:08:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說回來 春上以前住的第十九學區
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.45,0:08:53.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也經常發生吵鬧靈吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:54.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情況怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.16,0:08:59.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 不能拿這種事情亂起鬨吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.72,0:09:01.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是真的發生就麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.57,0:09:07.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比想像中要早結束呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.14,0:09:11.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說警備員接下來還要開會
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.43,0:09:14.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,固法學姐 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.14,0:09:19.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,RSPK症候群的集體發作 這我從來沒聽說過
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.56,0:09:21.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且 這次的對應手段...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.18,0:09:23.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓人很在意呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.14,0:09:28.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來就要請專家們好好調查了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.62,0:09:32.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在讓我們來想也沒用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.17,0:09:33.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說的的確有道理 不過...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.98,0:09:36.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 佐天 你們現在在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.29,0:09:44.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 春上接下來要玩什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:47.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看那個怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.70,0:09:49.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初春真熱血啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.01,0:09:51.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐大人也是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.49,0:09:52.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊不...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.61,0:09:54.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些硬幣感覺似曾相識呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.71,0:10:01.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 打地鼠？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.52,0:10:03.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 對 不過...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.43,0:10:04.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好懷念啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:08.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還是第一次玩這個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.27,0:10:11.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彭彭地冒出來 好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.47,0:10:18.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這 這樣啊 不過不要光看 你試著打下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.81,0:10:20.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打下去？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.33,0:10:25.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可憐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.27,0:10:27.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也 也是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.63,0:10:30.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就 就是 樂趣也是因人而異的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.00,0:10:32.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再來一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.97,0:10:35.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春上 玩到第四次就實在有點...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.75,0:10:37.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 要不要大家一起拍一下那個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.30,0:10:39.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:42.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那要拍了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.56,0:10:43.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.87,0:10:51.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發送
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.55,0:10:56.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞定 給
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:03.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼說呢 這女生有點不可思議
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.44,0:11:05.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎？不是挺可愛的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.77,0:11:09.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我想起了以前的初春
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.15,0:11:10.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.07,0:11:14.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊不 就是剛入學的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.31,0:11:16.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春上？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.25,0:11:18.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 危險
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.87,0:11:21.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒事吧 春上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.12,0:11:22.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.23,0:11:25.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.25,0:11:27.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個是...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.61,0:11:29.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,煙火大會的海報？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.40,0:11:32.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說就是今天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.76,0:11:34.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說 不如大家一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.84,0:11:37.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好主意 穿上浴衣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.02,0:11:38.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.42,0:11:42.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.91,0:11:43.95,*title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(421,10)}{\bord0\shad0}{\fad(150,0)}{\fscx92}#20{\fscx98\b0} {\1c&H4D81DF}亂雜開放
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.91,0:11:43.95,*title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(443,38)}{\bord0\shad0}{\fad(150,0)}{\1c&H4D81DF\fs12}<Poltergeist>
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.02,0:11:48.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是我第一次穿浴衣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.11,0:11:50.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.68,0:11:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼長的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.47,0:11:55.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正在查
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.19,0:11:57.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞清楚了 春上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.25,0:12:01.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像這樣 用繩子調整浴衣的長度
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.14,0:12:03.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好難哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.35,0:12:05.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.17,0:12:06.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.62,0:12:12.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看 首先要將前面疊在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.18,0:12:16.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 這鍊墜好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.29,0:12:20.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像是護身符一樣的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.40,0:12:22.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,護身符啊 真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.21,0:12:26.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我們趕快弄好這身浴衣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.82,0:12:27.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.95,0:12:30.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看 將前面疊在一起後 接下來是...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.15,0:12:34.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將浴衣的領邊往上提約20cm
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:36.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.87,0:12:38.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.67,0:12:41.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼照顧我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.38,0:12:43.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初春是個好人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.29,0:12:48.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好歹也是個風紀委員
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.12,0:12:54.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然這麼說 不過最近都只是掃掃街 找找遺失物罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.21,0:12:56.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找東西？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.55,0:13:00.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之 有什麼我能做到的 都會去做的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以放心依靠我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.95,0:13:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說...這麼急著叫我過來 還以為發生什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.98,0:13:11.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐 佐天 快來救命
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.84,0:13:15.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 搞定一個
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.45,0:13:16.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:19.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐天好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.12,0:13:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兩三下就弄得這麼好看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.52,0:13:25.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了好了 不抓緊就趕不上了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.54,0:13:30.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早知道會這樣 一開始就應該拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.06,0:13:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過初春不是很努力嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.67,0:13:38.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這次就輪到我來幫別人了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.42,0:13:39.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.53,0:13:43.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前 我風紀委員的考試都及格不了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.33,0:13:48.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄得我對其它事情都沒自信了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.37,0:13:53.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 當時的你 給人一種不能放著不管的感覺嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.84,0:14:00.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還好有佐天你們一直鼓勵我 幫我想辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.72,0:14:02.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？有嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.93,0:14:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.87,0:14:09.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,託你們的福 才能及格
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.88,0:14:16.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以這次 我希望能幫到春上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.52,0:14:22.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個...光我一個 還不是那麼可靠
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.14,0:14:22.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.65,0:14:26.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有初春當室友 真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:28.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我全靠你了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.26,0:14:31.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.04,0:14:34.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 不知不覺中都這麼出色了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.52,0:14:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐我很開心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.67,0:14:39.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明我的生日在你前面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.19,0:14:40.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個可以無視
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.09,0:14:41.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼意思嘛 討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.22,0:14:44.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂 先別動 衣服還沒穿好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.23,0:14:53.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.18,0:14:54.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走了...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.17,0:15:05.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好險
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.02,0:15:08.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次是真的沒問題了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:11.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功脫離
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.93,0:15:12.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.06,0:15:16.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 大概就只有我們宿舍是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.77,0:15:19.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到了煙火大會 門限都不能改
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.99,0:15:23.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐大人 你這樣亂動 衣服會走形的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.84,0:15:24.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.08,0:15:29.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再說 難得穿一次浴衣 還在下面套條短褲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.72,0:15:32.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這又怎樣 反正看不見
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.11,0:15:35.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在別人看不見的地方下功夫 才是少女的心得
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.82,0:15:38.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說回來 今天固法學姐不來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.70,0:15:42.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她說要調查一下亂雜開放現象
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.70,0:15:42.57,*Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(498,436)}<Poltergeist>
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.77,0:15:46.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開完會以後 一直放在心上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.13,0:15:49.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過的確挺奇怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.12,0:15:53.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,RSPK症候群竟然會集體發作
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.89,0:15:57.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉 真是沒完沒了了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.44,0:16:01.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,網路上有的消息也就這樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.62,0:16:05.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 御坂學姐好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.04,0:16:08.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白井也很可愛哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.47,0:16:09.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.28,0:16:12.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們也很可愛哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.64,0:16:15.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.94,0:16:18.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夜攤啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.27,0:16:20.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對哦 擺了好多攤呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.43,0:16:22.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好香～
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.03,0:16:23.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.07,0:16:24.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.87,0:16:27.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐大人 不能這樣子跑 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.51,0:16:30.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春上 我們也走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.73,0:16:31.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.55,0:17:01.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐大人你真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.08,0:17:04.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼嘛 今晚是祭典
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.55,0:17:05.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要的就是氣氛 氣氛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:07.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.87,0:17:11.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些車是幹嘛的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.37,0:17:12.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,MAR
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.88,0:17:15.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先進狀況救助隊的拖車
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.88,0:17:15.70,*Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(543,438)}<Trailer>
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.86,0:17:18.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因應亂雜開放的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.48,0:17:21.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亂雜開放？那那個謠言就是真的囉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.48,0:17:21.48,*Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(262,436)}<Poltergeist>
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.62,0:17:26.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡人那麼多 萬一發生亂雜開放就不得了了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.16,0:17:30.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說回來 竟然要在那種警備下看煙火
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.93,0:17:33.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,實在是大煞風景啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.01,0:17:36.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣吧 我想到了個好地方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.74,0:17:44.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是鮮有人知的好地方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.67,0:17:47.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 又放上來了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.15,0:17:53.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像體內咚的一聲響呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.92,0:17:57.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 咚的一聲響
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.61,0:18:04.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.38,0:18:12.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉 早知道我也去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.06,0:18:16.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然很在意 但是繼續查下去也...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.99,0:18:23.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,AIM擴散力場
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.67,0:18:28.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玉屋～
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.05,0:18:30.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鍵屋～
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.05,0:18:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又來了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.27,0:18:34.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玉屋～
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.75,0:18:38.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.29,0:18:42.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.17,0:18:44.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想起什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.32,0:18:53.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實 我以前也有像初春和佐天一樣的...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.16,0:18:58.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春上？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.80,0:18:59.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.81,0:19:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.75,0:19:04.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.95,0:19:05.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.45,0:19:09.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她們要去哪裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.59,0:19:14.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她們肯定是很識相地讓我們獨處啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.45,0:19:17.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來 讓我們也像煙火那樣激情燃燒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.18,0:19:19.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好熱 熱死啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.92,0:19:20.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚也要...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.81,0:19:23.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你手機響了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.90,0:19:25.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 是誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.19,0:19:29.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼事啊 固法學姐 現在這時候...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.89,0:19:30.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽我說聽我說
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.77,0:19:32.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,關於亂雜開放
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.74,0:19:36.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然喜歡探究是好事 不過稍微放鬆一下如何
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.26,0:19:39.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,煙火很漂亮哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.23,0:19:40.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夠了 先聽我說
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.97,0:19:44.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,RSPK症候群的集體發作的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.31,0:19:48.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是針對AIM擴散力場的人為干涉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.40,0:19:51.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,針對AIM擴散力場...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.22,0:19:56.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說 一連串的亂雜開放並不是偶發事故
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.23,0:19:58.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪裡 你在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.51,0:20:01.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春上...？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.36,0:20:03.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.02,0:20:06.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說有人故意引發的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.37,0:20:13.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白井？喂 白井
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.02,0:20:14.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.29,0:20:17.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道是 亂雜開放
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.50,0:20:21.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.64,0:20:26.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐天她們呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.81,0:20:28.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初春
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.34,0:20:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初春！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.79,0:20:48.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐天 沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.68,0:21:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千鈞一髮呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.44,0:21:05.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒受傷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.63,0:21:07.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.64,0:21:09.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.53,0:21:17.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春上 春上
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.90,0:21:22.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春上 沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.72,0:21:23.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別勉強自己
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.05,0:21:30.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪裡 你...在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.86,0:21:34.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春上？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.84,0:21:43.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.63,0:21:47.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那裡崩塌了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.21,0:21:49.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生事故了？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.86,0:23:32.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪裡 在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.92,0:23:34.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在右邊啊 春上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.85,0:23:36.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走過頭了 往左啊 左邊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.04,0:23:38.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們在玩打西瓜嗎
